purge-service-stopped
purge-no-packaged-files
purge-not-activatable
purge-state-unchanged
purge-account-kept
purge-notice-keys
reinstall-after-purge-keys-listed
reinstall-after-purge-signs-with-polkit
reinstall-after-purge-no-import
# F133: the kind a key gets with the TPM of the run (swtpm), in the import result, the API's list, `custodio list` and the journal. Skipped under the other modes (skip.list).
tpm-kind-import-rsa
tpm-kind-import-ec
tpm-kind-api-list
tpm-kind-cli-list
tpm-kind-journal
# F134: every mechanism signs under each kind; run in every TPM mode (swtpm, none, lacking), never skipped.
sign-kind-matches-mode
sign-rsa-pkcs
sign-rsa-pss-sha256
sign-rsa-pss-sha384
sign-rsa-pss-sha512
sign-rsa-composed
sign-ec-ecdsa
