# F135: no plaintext key in the state directory after each import; run in every TPM mode (swtpm, none, lacking), never skipped.
noplain-rsa
noplain-ec
noplain-no-key-file
tpm-dup-authpolicy-empty
tpm-dup-duplicate-fails
tpm-dup-other-tpm

# F137: every TPM and TPM-bound key still signs after PCRs are extended and the TPM and the service restarted; skipped in none (no TPM), run in swtpm and lacking.
pcr-extended-signs
pcr-restarted-signs
pcr-signs-every-key

# F138: the kind after import and what the CLI says (acceptance 6). The host cases run in none (kind encrypted-host); the tpmbound cases are skipped in every mode (SPEC_DEVIATIONS.md, F134).
